{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/ed1bfc13f3ab793ad17e724c58c4ddee.avif?t=1772922710\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/b63088b486ffcc0ff3d167f445b4863f.poster.avif?t=1772922710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/b63088b486ffcc0ff3d167f445b4863f.webm?t=1772922710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/b63088b486ffcc0ff3d167f445b4863f.mp4?t=1772922710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging tactical combat involving the use of dozens of available abilities. Each party member brings with them different specialties and it's up to you how to combine them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/b8b9b63e83b7ecb873fb0b358923baed.avif?t=1772922710\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/a399545df23621922c4cc9b5177aa7c3.poster.avif?t=1772922710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/a399545df23621922c4cc9b5177aa7c3.webm?t=1772922710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/a399545df23621922c4cc9b5177aa7c3.mp4?t=1772922710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a party of adventurers through a large open world filled with towns to explore, dungeons to conquer, hidden secrets to find as you grow in power and take on more dangerous regions and more epic quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/dfa71d2bc03befc75ae96b13c3eff7c1.poster.avif?t=1772922710\" width=1170 height=752 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/dfa71d2bc03befc75ae96b13c3eff7c1.webm?t=1772922710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/140350276dc885bd3f62ce0e748ea607.avif?t=1772922710\" width=600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a variety of different premade NPCs to choose from or for those who prefer to create their entire parties, you can completely customise your party members with a deep character creator including all skills, classes, combat sprites and character portraits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752020/extras/1987ef8d74c3eb6bbb81fb441bb979e6.poste